causal-sets needs causal-structure: only causal relations among points are kept as basic
regge-calculus needs riemann-tensor: curvature becomes deficit angles concentrated on 2D bones
regge-calculus needs dirac-delta-function: curvature is a delta function on the bones, flat elsewhere
