conformal-group needs orthogonal-group: the conformal group is the pseudo-orthogonal group O(2,4)
compactified-minkowski-space needs minkowski-space: adds a light cone at infinity to Minkowski space
compactified-minkowski-space needs conformal-group: the conformal group acts globally only on the compactified space
