nonlinear-graviton needs sheaf-cohomology: deforming patches by cohomology data yields curved twistor spaces
nonlinear-graviton needs self-dual-weyl-curvature: the resulting spacetimes have purely anti-self-dual Weyl curvature
nonlinear-graviton needs einstein-field-equations: the spacetimes automatically solve the vacuum Einstein equations
